    "text": "By HRMessenger Staff ,\n16 hours ago NORFOLK, Va. – Hampton Roads Transit (HRT) is prepared to help move thousands of people expected during events June 19-22 that include Juneteenth, Sail250 Virginia, Harborfest and the Portsmouth Seawall Festival. As previously announced, HRT will offer free transit on all modes of travel on Friday, June 19, in... Read full article",
